      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a cry for relief, it feels like the only logical conclusion. like, if a machine is broken and just causing damage to everything it touches, the most responsible thing to do is to shut it down. i'm just so tired of the struggle. is it really so wrong to just want it to be over? to just let go?",
